    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience unprecedented speed and passion! This revolutionary motion-sensing racing game utilizes advanced artificial intelligence computer vision technology to recognize your hand gestures through a computer camera. No need for a mouse, keyboard, touchpad, or any wearable devices\u2014simply wave your palm in the air to control the race car and enjoy the cool driving fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether in easy mode or hard mode, this game brings both fun and challenges. Swing your palms left or right to steer the race car, quickly move your palm up to release a protective shield, and move it down to deactivate the shield, helping you race unimpeded on the track.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come join us and experience this innovative motion-sensing racing game, and become the king of the racetrack!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience unprecedented speed and passion! This revolutionary motion-sensing racing game utilizes advanced artificial intelligence computer vision technology to recognize your hand gestures through a computer camera. No need for a mouse, keyboard, touchpad, or any wearable devices\u2014simply wave your palm in the air to control the race car and enjoy the cool driving fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether in easy mode or hard mode, this game brings both fun and challenges. Swing your palms left or right to steer the race car, quickly move your palm up to release a protective shield, and move it down to deactivate the shield, helping you race unimpeded on the track.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come join us and experience this innovative motion-sensing racing game, and become the king of the racetrack!</p>",
